        # fifth page held the cheapest fit while two pages a query were read; when the loop listed the line by a shelf browse and made no
        # words search the sweep stood blocked although the browse's next page held the cheapest fit. Three moves inside the same page
        # envelope: PAGEON - the base query is read to its end when the rows its reply counts fit the sweep's remaining page reads;
